<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica Capital Alliance nabs Old Mutual's Shapiro.</title>
<headline>SAfrica Capital Alliance nabs Old Mutual's Shapiro.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Black financial services group Capital Alliance said on Wednesday Arnold Shapiro had joined its asset management subsidiary Capital Alliance Investment Counsel as chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Shapiro, until recently senior portfolio manager at South Africa's biggest life assurer Old Mutual, would work with chief investment officer Steven Mills in developing Capital Alliance's asset management business.</p>
<p>Capital Alliance Holdings was formerly known as AGA Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
